%% dsh-skill-center — 调用时序（写路径：开关 + 软链拒绝）
%% 由 docs/system_design.md §4.2 抽出；两者必须同批更新。
%% 读取路径（list / 首次打开）见 system_design.md §4.1，不放本文件以免出现「一个文件两份图」的解析歧义。

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant SW as EnableSwitch
    participant PG as SkillsPage
    participant ST as PageStore
    participant API as SkillCenterApi
    participant RT as RouteTable
    participant SC as SkillScanner
    participant FM as FrontmatterCodec
    participant AW as AtomicWriter
    participant FS as SKILL.md

    U->>SW: 点击开关
    SW->>PG: onToggle(row, !row.enabled)
    PG->>ST: actions.pending(identityKey)
    Note over PG,SW: 不做乐观 UI：开关 disabled + StateDot(ongoing) + aria-live 播报
    PG->>API: toggle({name, path, enabled})
    API->>RT: POST api/dsh-skill-center/toggle
    RT->>RT: isLoopbackRequest(req) 失败则 403 E_FORBIDDEN
    RT->>SC: 重新扫描（磁盘是唯一真源）
    SC-->>RT: row 或 undefined
    alt row 不存在
        RT-->>API: 404 E_NOT_FOUND
    else row.symlink 为 true
        RT-->>API: 409 E_SYMLINK_READONLY
        Note over RT,FS: 不写任何字节（队长决策：软链只读）
    else row.path 与提交的 path 不一致
        RT-->>API: 409 E_STALE_PATH
        Note over RT: 拒绝过期同名回退
    else 身份校验通过
        RT->>FM: setDisableModelInvocation(bytes, !enabled)
        FM-->>RT: next 字节与 changed 标记
        RT->>AW: writeDisableFlag(row.path, !enabled)
        AW->>FS: lstat 后 read 并 fstat 取指纹
        AW->>FS: 写 tmp(wx) 后 fsync 并复核指纹再 rename
        AW->>FS: 回读并逐字节校验
        alt 校验失败
            AW->>FS: 回滚原字节
            AW-->>RT: E_VERIFY_FAILED
            RT-->>API: 500 E_VERIFY_FAILED
        else 成功
            AW-->>RT: path 与 disableModelInvocation
            RT-->>API: 200 {code:'OK', data:{name, enabled, modelInvocable, path}}
        end
    end
    alt 成功
        API-->>PG: ToggleResult
        PG->>ST: actions.commit(identityKey, enabled)
        PG-->>U: 新状态（下一次 list 亦一致）
    else 失败
        API-->>PG: ApiError{code}
        PG->>ST: actions.fail(identityKey, code)
        PG-->>U: 开关回弹 + 行内 .skc_reason
    end
